<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish shares closed higher in 12-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing 0.9 percent higher at 1,699.9 points.</p>
<p>Ten stocks closed higher, two lower and seven were flat.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.7 percent in 9.8-million- zloty-trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
